Version Beta 0.13.0
=====
SEMANTIC CHANGES (No command or anything in the way Slacker works or its philosophy has been tampered with.)
- Update: slacker-cli
    - refactoring slacker-cli/src
      main.rs had become huge with thousands of lines of code. Of course this wasn't a problem and a grep on a single file would have given us exactly what we were looking for. But in the future a novice forker or developer would have a hard time understanding where what goes, and what does what...
      Τhe ARCHITECTURE.md file was added, so after separating main.rs into various rs, anyone who reads ARCHITECTURE.md can immediately understand where what goes and what not to touch...
- Update: slacker-gui _beta.5
    - Added a slackware-mark.svg to the empty space to the left of the menu.
- Update scripts
    - Added scripts/DEV
      This folder contains info and tools for developers and LLMs:
      - ARCHITECTURE-el.md  (greeks)
      - README
      - refactor-plan.md  (refactored steps and suggestions)
      - slacker-refactor-harness.tar.gz (script and tools used by Claude LLM for refactoring step by step)
Everything was tested very hard, I m very happy for this release because now a future developer can easy work on slacker.

---

